{
 "encounter_id": "00727",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Cold sore. Again. Third this year."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Sorry to hear that. Where is it?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Top lip. Left side. Tingled yesterday, now it's blistered."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "When did the first one come, this year?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "January? Or February. I'm not sure."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That's fine. What sets them off, do you notice? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Sun. Stress. Colds. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What are you using on it now?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Aciclovir cream, five times a day, from the chemist."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Does it help? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A bit. Not much. If I start it early. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Anything else you use?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Lip balm with sun cream in it, every morning."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good habit. Do you have any other conditions?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Eczema, hands. That's all."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me look at it. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Go on.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's a typical blister. Don't touch it, and wash your hands after you put the cream on. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "The key with the cream is to start it at the very first tingle, and to keep it up for five days."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I start late. I forget. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Keep the tube in your bag and in your bathroom. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If they keep happening, there are tablets you can take for a few days at the first tingle, or even every day to prevent them. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Prevent them? That'd be good. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in four weeks to talk about it, if it's still bothering you, and I'll start you on that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. Thanks. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Avoid kissing or sharing towels while it's blistered."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Take care. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "See you. ~"
  }
